WEBVTT

00:00:02.009 --> 00:00:03.344
2010:

00:00:03.427 --> 00:00:07.556
Catia had already established
an Earth defense organization.

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:09.099
Its headquarters were built in secrecy

00:00:09.183 --> 00:00:10.684
in a certain residence in Okinawa,

00:00:10.768 --> 00:00:13.938
and under the level-headed
Supreme Commander Eris,

00:00:14.021 --> 00:00:17.983
they bravely challenged
Dogishua around the clock.

00:00:18.067 --> 00:00:20.694
The best minds in the
universe came together to create

00:00:20.778 --> 00:00:22.905
the Catian mechanics.

00:00:22.988 --> 00:00:26.659
They were ready to
handle the hostile Dogishuans.

00:00:34.708 --> 00:00:36.460
I'm still inexperienced

00:00:36.544 --> 00:00:42.258
There are many answers before my eyes

00:00:42.341 --> 00:00:49.473
How many equal parts
can you divide one sky into?

00:00:49.557 --> 00:00:51.350
Give me them all,
because they're so much fun

00:00:51.433 --> 00:00:53.102
I want them all to myself

00:00:53.185 --> 00:00:56.522
My true colors spill into the blue sky

00:00:56.605 --> 00:01:04.238
Man! I'll write your
name down so I don't lose it

00:01:04.321 --> 00:01:06.031
Why don't you get serious?

00:01:06.115 --> 00:01:11.287
I won't let you tell me you don't like to

00:01:11.370 --> 00:01:18.043
A pure love device (Set up now) and start it up

00:01:18.127 --> 00:01:22.131
On a runway of impatience and dreams

00:01:22.214 --> 00:01:26.010
fasten your seatbelt even tighter

00:01:26.093 --> 00:01:32.891
A cutting-edge device
(Back up now) it's starting up

00:01:32.975 --> 00:01:36.937
I want the original

00:01:37.021 --> 00:01:40.649
of your heart, at least,

00:01:40.733 --> 00:01:44.653
and I've put together a plan

00:01:48.991 --> 00:01:52.870
"Cat Planet Cuties"

00:02:02.755 --> 00:02:06.008
The situation had been in
the works for a long, long time.

00:02:08.552 --> 00:02:09.720
Fire!

00:02:30.199 --> 00:02:32.493
Wow! It's so pretty!

00:02:32.576 --> 00:02:34.578
Christmas is almost here, after all.

00:02:34.662 --> 00:02:40.000
This is how believers celebrate
the birth of their first founder?

00:02:40.084 --> 00:02:42.378
It's not like everyone is a believer.

00:02:42.461 --> 00:02:43.837
They're not?

00:02:43.921 --> 00:02:45.756
| don't know about other countries,

00:02:45.839 --> 00:02:48.967
but in Japan,
everyone celebrates it regardless.

00:02:49.051 --> 00:02:53.472
It's like a festival,
or an event, you might say.

00:02:55.182 --> 00:02:58.811
Hey, Aoi, what are you going to
do for Christmas this year?

00:02:58.894 --> 00:03:00.020
What am I going to do?

00:03:00.104 --> 00:03:02.731
For Kio. You're taking him out, right?

00:03:02.815 --> 00:03:04.024
H-Huh?

00:03:04.108 --> 00:03:08.195
What are you so surprised about?
This chance only comes once a year.

00:03:08.278 --> 00:03:10.114
You've got to earn some points
by getting him a present,

00:03:10.197 --> 00:03:12.032
and asking him out on a date.

00:03:12.116 --> 00:03:14.993
But Kio seems so busy.

00:03:15.077 --> 00:03:17.663
What he's busy with is Eris,

00:03:17.746 --> 00:03:20.416
so you can't be too concerned about that.

00:03:20.624 --> 00:03:21.667
--Remember, four months have passed now,

00:03:21.667 --> 00:03:23.043
--Adorable, isn't it?
--Remember, four months have passed now,

00:03:23.127 --> 00:03:23.293
--Yes. How much would it cost to buy this?

00:03:23.293 --> 00:03:25.879
--And it doesn't look like their relationship is
developing, --Yes. How much would it cost to buy this?

00:03:25.879 --> 00:03:27.214
--So your chances are still wide open.
--Yes. How much would it cost to buy this?

00:03:27.214 --> 00:03:28.674
--So your chances are still wide open.
--It says ¥1200.

00:03:28.757 --> 00:03:31.135
In fact, now, when their
relationship has stabilized,

00:03:31.218 --> 00:03:32.594
is the time to strike.

00:03:32.678 --> 00:03:34.847
| wouldn't think of it as striking.

00:03:34.930 --> 00:03:38.308
If I push too hard, it might upset Kio.

00:03:38.392 --> 00:03:41.311
Geez, is your heart in this, or isn't it?

00:03:41.395 --> 00:03:45.774
Any chance event for you
is also a chance event for her.

00:03:45.858 --> 00:03:47.901
Do you want to let Christmas
become an opportunity

00:03:47.985 --> 00:03:50.446
for Kio and Eris to get closer?

00:03:50.529 --> 00:03:53.365
You've got to go after
him with enough gusto

00:03:53.449 --> 00:03:56.827
to close the deal,
before she gets the chance!

00:03:56.910 --> 00:04:00.205
C-Close the deal with Kio...?

00:04:00.289 --> 00:04:03.459
Eris' next mating season
may be a little while off,

00:04:03.542 --> 00:04:06.170
but we humans are okay
to go year-round, right?

00:04:06.253 --> 00:04:09.214
When you've got a
good hand, you have to play it.

00:04:10.257 --> 00:04:12.843
Come on! You like Kio, don't you?

00:04:12.926 --> 00:04:13.886
| like him, but...

00:04:13.969 --> 00:04:15.179
Futaba!

00:04:16.138 --> 00:04:19.016
Listen, Futaba, I want you...

00:04:22.352 --> 00:04:25.606
Of all the things for you
to say in a place like this!

00:04:25.689 --> 00:04:27.733
You should save that
for when you're alone together,

00:04:27.816 --> 00:04:28.817
some place romantic--

00:04:28.901 --> 00:04:32.446
Huh? I was just telling Futaba
that I wanted her to know

00:04:32.529 --> 00:04:36.617
that I found a sale on
the Ichikawa Raizen DVDs

00:04:36.700 --> 00:04:38.660
that she likes to collect.

00:04:50.255 --> 00:04:53.050
No matter how many
times I see it, it's a great movie.

00:04:53.133 --> 00:04:56.428
It smacks of relying too much on religion,

00:04:56.512 --> 00:04:59.056
but as an ideal model case
for the goodwill of mankind,

00:04:59.139 --> 00:05:00.557
it's outstanding.

00:05:00.641 --> 00:05:02.226
| understand that on Earth,

00:05:02.309 --> 00:05:05.020
they have an event called
Christmas during this season.

00:05:05.103 --> 00:05:07.105
The original intent
was apparently to celebrate

00:05:07.189 --> 00:05:12.236
the birth of the founder of
one of Earth's three great religions,

00:05:12.319 --> 00:05:15.322
but as you can see, it has changed
to become a day, once a year,

00:05:15.405 --> 00:05:17.908
when people are
especially nice to each other.

00:05:17.991 --> 00:05:21.620
| just made an inquiry
to the home world about this,

00:05:21.703 --> 00:05:25.249
and they passed a resolution
that we should also exchange gifts

00:05:25.332 --> 00:05:27.376
to coincide with their event.

00:05:29.044 --> 00:05:32.589
On Earth, they make use of an
imaginary person, named Santa Claus,

00:05:32.673 --> 00:05:36.426
as a symbol of these
voluntary acts of goodwill.

00:05:36.510 --> 00:05:39.596
As such, I would like
for us to put this program,

00:05:39.680 --> 00:05:44.852
which we will call
"Operation Santa Claus," into motion.

00:05:44.852 --> 00:05:44.977
"Alert" which we will call
"Operation Santa Claus," into motion.

00:05:44.977 --> 00:05:45.310
"Alert"

00:05:47.104 --> 00:05:49.481
Captain! I'm picking up multiple objects

00:05:49.565 --> 00:05:51.358
approaching the ship at high speed!

00:05:51.441 --> 00:05:55.362
All hands to alert status.
Bring up the scan data.

00:05:55.445 --> 00:05:58.282
They are all artificial Earth satellites.

00:05:58.365 --> 00:06:00.325
It's all scrap, past its service life.

00:06:00.409 --> 00:06:03.370
More of the dogs' harassment debris.

00:06:03.453 --> 00:06:08.333
Prepare to fire phasers.
Target the harassment debris.

00:06:08.417 --> 00:06:09.835
Ready to fire.

00:06:09.918 --> 00:06:11.086
Fire!

00:06:25.767 --> 00:06:29.521
Direct hit. Target destroyed.
Neutralization is confirmed.

00:06:29.605 --> 00:06:32.691
Reading no signs of movement or energy.

00:06:32.774 --> 00:06:36.737
Good grief. Those dogs
are always after cheap shots.

00:06:36.820 --> 00:06:39.615
Our hull is made of tilsonite
and reinforced tektite.

00:06:39.698 --> 00:06:42.576
Debris like that won't
even put a scratch in it.

00:06:42.659 --> 00:06:46.330
It's not like they can come right
out and launch an attack against us.

00:06:46.413 --> 00:06:48.665
The Dogishuan race is not allowed

00:06:48.749 --> 00:06:51.793
to develop any new contacts, after all.

00:06:51.877 --> 00:06:54.630
They can only take action below the surface.

00:06:54.713 --> 00:06:59.217
Even so, they keep doing
this kind of thing to annoy us.

00:06:59.301 --> 00:07:02.596
Stand down from alert status.
Continue observation.

00:07:02.679 --> 00:07:04.014
Acknowledged.

00:07:04.097 --> 00:07:06.433
Uh, and please put a ribbon on it.

00:07:06.516 --> 00:07:08.352
A Christmas ribbon?

00:07:08.435 --> 00:07:09.603
Yes.

00:07:18.862 --> 00:07:20.697
You've got to earn some
points by getting him a present,

00:07:20.781 --> 00:07:23.241
and asking him out on a date.

00:07:23.325 --> 00:07:25.494
Can I do that...?

00:07:25.577 --> 00:07:26.662
And your points?

00:07:26.745 --> 00:07:29.122
No, I haven't made any yet.

00:07:29.206 --> 00:07:33.543
Uh, you do have some points saved up.
Would you like to use them?

00:07:33.627 --> 00:07:36.755
Oh... Please save them to my card.

00:07:39.758 --> 00:07:44.471
Transmission from the home world.
It's the Santa Claus time schedule.

00:07:44.554 --> 00:07:47.724
There's still plenty of time before Christmas.

00:07:47.808 --> 00:07:49.393
Calculate our entry trajectory

00:07:49.476 --> 00:07:52.270
and synchronous orbital velocity, Melwin.

00:07:52.354 --> 00:07:53.939
Yes, Captain.

00:07:54.022 --> 00:07:57.734
I'm going to go greet
the dignitaries on Earth,

00:07:57.818 --> 00:08:00.237
so can you keep an eye
on things here for a while?

00:08:00.320 --> 00:08:03.115
You mean, I'd be acting captain?

00:08:03.198 --> 00:08:05.325
You can handle that much, can't you?

00:08:05.409 --> 00:08:07.369
Y-Yes, I'll do my best!

00:08:07.452 --> 00:08:09.454
Doctor, about the item...

00:08:09.538 --> 00:08:12.332
It's all ready.
Go ahead and take it with you.

00:08:12.416 --> 00:08:14.001
What item is that?

00:08:14.084 --> 00:08:17.879
A little early Christmas present for Kio.

00:08:17.963 --> 00:08:21.508
I'm going to be treated by them,
so I should at least take a gift.

00:08:22.801 --> 00:08:24.594
Yum!

00:08:24.678 --> 00:08:27.180
Mm, so delicious...

00:08:27.264 --> 00:08:29.057
The sweetness of the blackened parts,

00:08:29.141 --> 00:08:31.226
together with the exquisite harmony

00:08:31.309 --> 00:08:33.770
of the firm chewiness of the meat

00:08:33.854 --> 00:08:38.108
as the grease runs off from the
heat of the rice and mixes together...

00:08:41.903 --> 00:08:44.781
Ah, it's great! It's so great!

00:08:44.865 --> 00:08:47.034
It's been so long since I've had yakiniku!

00:08:47.117 --> 00:08:49.870
It's the best!

00:08:49.953 --> 00:08:53.582
The little ones made today's yakiniku.

00:08:53.582 --> 00:08:53.623
"Heh heh"
The little ones made today's yakiniku.

00:08:53.623 --> 00:08:53.999
"Heh heh"

00:08:54.041 --> 00:08:54.750
"Heh heh!"

00:08:54.791 --> 00:08:55.042
"Heh heh!!"

00:08:55.333 --> 00:08:58.086
By marinating, cooking,
and stewing the meat,

00:08:58.170 --> 00:09:00.672
it may take a lot of time and trouble,

00:09:00.756 --> 00:09:03.258
but we all learned how, and mastered it.

00:09:03.341 --> 00:09:05.635
You've all outdone yourselves.

00:09:05.719 --> 00:09:09.473
Now we can have a steady
supply of yakiniku on the mother ship!

00:09:09.556 --> 00:09:12.893
Eris, all of your Assistroids
are such good workers, huh?

00:09:12.976 --> 00:09:13.727
Yes.

00:09:13.769 --> 00:09:15.479
Now that you mention it, Captain,

00:09:15.562 --> 00:09:17.856
didn't you bring an Assistroid with you?

00:09:17.939 --> 00:09:20.400
Yes, I did.

00:09:20.484 --> 00:09:22.527
It's contained inside here.

00:09:23.779 --> 00:09:25.614
Bells like the ones that Chayka and I wear

00:09:25.697 --> 00:09:28.825
just indicate rank and serve as communicators,

00:09:28.909 --> 00:09:30.410
but senior officers' bells

00:09:30.494 --> 00:09:33.413
serve as multitasking organizers.

00:09:33.497 --> 00:09:36.416
Multitasking organizers?

00:09:36.500 --> 00:09:38.960
It can juggle around the
atomic composition of matter,

00:09:39.044 --> 00:09:42.714
and take elements
from the air and solidify them.

00:09:42.798 --> 00:09:44.508
And naturally, it's also a weapon.

00:09:44.591 --> 00:09:46.843
Wow, that's amazing.

00:09:46.927 --> 00:09:50.180
Oh, right, before I forget...

00:09:51.765 --> 00:09:53.350
Let's see...

00:09:55.102 --> 00:09:56.686
There it is.

00:10:00.357 --> 00:10:02.275
Here. For you, Kio.

00:10:04.528 --> 00:10:05.529
What is it?

00:10:05.612 --> 00:10:10.117
You mentioned before that you
wanted some emergency gear, right?

00:10:10.200 --> 00:10:12.744
It's a combat power suit.

00:10:12.828 --> 00:10:14.496
Thank you very much!

00:10:14.579 --> 00:10:16.790
There's a bit of a trick to using it,

00:10:16.873 --> 00:10:18.667
so have Eris show you afterward.

00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:20.127
Right.

00:10:22.003 --> 00:10:24.089
Is something the matter, Eris?

00:10:24.172 --> 00:10:26.550
I'm just a little sad.

00:10:27.759 --> 00:10:32.055
| was thinking that you
shouldn't have to arm yourself, Kio.

00:10:32.139 --> 00:10:36.643
| know it sounds pathetic.
But I've long thought that

00:10:36.726 --> 00:10:40.814
doing nothing, and always putting Eris,
Futaba and everyone out

00:10:40.897 --> 00:10:45.527
really is not right.
Besides, I am a guy, remember.

00:10:45.610 --> 00:10:48.572
| really don't understand the
concept that because you're male,

00:10:48.655 --> 00:10:54.494
you have to fight,
but I am glad you feel that way, Kio.

00:10:54.578 --> 00:10:59.583
But I do wish that it didn't
have to manifest itself in this manner.

00:10:59.666 --> 00:11:03.253
Then let's keep up our
diplomatic efforts to that end.

00:11:03.336 --> 00:11:05.672
Once we establish proper diplomatic channels,

00:11:05.755 --> 00:11:09.384
Kio won't have to
use equipment like this, after all.

00:11:09.467 --> 00:11:10.719
Right.

00:11:13.180 --> 00:11:15.432
The time is just about right.

00:11:15.515 --> 00:11:17.475
What do you think, Matrey?

00:11:19.227 --> 00:11:20.562
"I concur"

00:11:21.021 --> 00:11:23.315
All right. Moving to stage two.

00:11:23.398 --> 00:11:27.194
Contact your pals.
It's time to start moving.

00:11:42.709 --> 00:11:44.294
--Cat Planet Cuties.
--Cat Planet Cuties.

00:11:58.391 --> 00:12:00.143
Manami?

00:12:00.227 --> 00:12:01.394
Aoi...

00:12:02.187 --> 00:12:03.980
I'll be right down.

00:12:08.443 --> 00:12:11.029
So, what did you buy for a present?

00:12:11.112 --> 00:12:15.533
The DVD box set of the
"Bantohan and Dechidon" movies.

00:12:15.617 --> 00:12:17.786
Huh? What's that?

00:12:17.869 --> 00:12:21.790
It used to be on TV a long time ago.
Omura Kon appeared on it.

00:12:21.873 --> 00:12:25.418
He reminds me a lot of Sadayan,
so I thought Kio might like it.

00:12:25.502 --> 00:12:28.421
Ugh, I don't mean to
poke my nose into your tastes,

00:12:28.505 --> 00:12:30.257
so I'll just let that slide,

00:12:30.340 --> 00:12:31.800
but why didn't you at least
choose something romantic

00:12:31.883 --> 00:12:34.010
that the two of you
could watch alone together?!

00:12:34.094 --> 00:12:35.845
What can I say?

00:12:35.929 --> 00:12:37.347
And while watching these movies,

00:12:37.430 --> 00:12:39.724
do you think you can work up to a kiss?

00:12:39.808 --> 00:12:41.434
A-A kiss?!

00:12:41.518 --> 00:12:44.980
S-Something like that...
shouldn't be rushed...

00:12:45.063 --> 00:12:46.815
it should follow after our mutual feelings...

00:12:46.898 --> 00:12:49.317
If you don't give those
mutual feelings a push now,

00:12:49.401 --> 00:12:53.280
then when will you?
This is Christmas, you know. Christmas!

00:12:53.363 --> 00:12:54.614
Well...

00:12:54.698 --> 00:12:57.158
Oh, I know! Valentine's Day.

00:12:57.242 --> 00:13:01.663
Wishful thinking! What if you
get beaten to the punch first?

00:13:02.914 --> 00:13:07.711
But I'm happy the way things are now.

00:13:07.794 --> 00:13:12.215
The way things are now,
just being able to be with Kio,

00:13:12.299 --> 00:13:14.676
I'm more than happy, so...

00:13:14.759 --> 00:13:15.927
Stop it.

00:13:16.678 --> 00:13:20.140
You're only going to be able to say that now.

00:13:21.433 --> 00:13:23.435
Manami...?

00:13:23.518 --> 00:13:28.648
Listen, once those feelings
turn some other way, it's too late.

00:13:28.732 --> 00:13:31.609
You can't turn back time, after all.

00:13:32.861 --> 00:13:37.741
Make sure that doesn't happen.
If your feelings are true,

00:13:37.824 --> 00:13:41.077
you have to act on them right away.

00:13:42.245 --> 00:13:46.166
If you're too bashful, and too
self-conscious, you'll regret it.

00:13:50.003 --> 00:13:51.713
That's why...

00:13:52.881 --> 00:13:54.466
That's why...

00:14:11.358 --> 00:14:12.942
Apport!

00:14:28.208 --> 00:14:28.875
"Catian Ambassy"

00:14:36.883 --> 00:14:38.301
W-What is this?!

00:14:38.385 --> 00:14:40.970
Everyone, defensive positions!

00:14:42.097 --> 00:14:44.099
What's the matter, everyone?

00:14:44.182 --> 00:14:48.103
This smoke is nephelter gas!
Their sensors have been blocked!

00:14:48.186 --> 00:14:50.146
All units, standby mode!

00:14:55.402 --> 00:14:56.444
Incoming!

00:14:56.528 --> 00:14:58.238
Let's get out through the back yard!

00:14:58.321 --> 00:15:01.533
Don't come this way!

00:15:01.616 --> 00:15:03.159
What about my power suit?

00:15:03.243 --> 00:15:06.162
It hasn't been initialized yet,
so you can't use it!

00:15:06.246 --> 00:15:07.831
Let's flee to the second floor!

00:15:07.914 --> 00:15:08.915
All right!

00:15:08.998 --> 00:15:10.375
Acknowledged!

00:15:22.220 --> 00:15:22.679
"Alert"

00:15:22.679 --> 00:15:24.597
"Alert"
Third external hull has been breached!

00:15:24.597 --> 00:15:24.681
"Alert"

00:15:24.681 --> 00:15:26.558
"Alert" Picking up an
energy reading! It's an attack!

00:15:26.558 --> 00:15:26.891
Picking up an energy
reading! It's an attack!

00:15:26.975 --> 00:15:30.687
I'm declaring a level-3 emergency!
Give me a damage report!

00:15:30.770 --> 00:15:32.564
What is attacking us?

00:15:32.647 --> 00:15:35.608
Reading six objects in motion
aboard the ship without ID codes--

00:15:35.692 --> 00:15:37.110
No, seven!

00:15:37.193 --> 00:15:39.571
Their size is small.
They're Assistroids!

00:15:45.243 --> 00:15:48.997
Mobilize security personnel!
Armament level 3-- no, 4!

00:15:49.080 --> 00:15:50.707
Send Assistroids in, as well!

00:15:50.790 --> 00:15:51.875
Acknowledged!

00:15:51.958 --> 00:15:53.710
Commence locking down the bridge!

00:15:53.793 --> 00:15:55.920
Acknowledged. Space-time secured.

00:15:56.004 --> 00:15:58.256
System physical separation complete.

00:15:58.339 --> 00:16:01.468
Short-term hyperspace
command systems all green.

00:16:02.760 --> 00:16:05.180
All hands, maintain your positions.

00:16:05.263 --> 00:16:07.640
Keep a tight, thorough defensive posture!

00:16:07.724 --> 00:16:10.059
Leave the counterattack
to the security personnel!

00:16:10.143 --> 00:16:12.979
How in the world did they manage this?

00:16:13.062 --> 00:16:15.732
There weren't any signs of
any spacecraft around the ship.

00:16:15.815 --> 00:16:17.775
So where'd they come from...?

00:16:44.093 --> 00:16:45.261
Fire!

00:16:46.804 --> 00:16:49.849
It couldn't be...
They were in the harassment debris?

00:16:59.859 --> 00:17:02.195
They were prepared
to sacrifice their Assistroids

00:17:02.278 --> 00:17:04.113
when they launched them?

00:17:05.281 --> 00:17:07.909
Have they no personal pride?

00:17:25.176 --> 00:17:25.969
What?!

00:17:26.010 --> 00:17:27.971
Masks! It's cat powder gas!

00:18:01.254 --> 00:18:02.630
This way!

00:18:05.300 --> 00:18:07.677
"Sleep tight, my friend"

00:18:18.104 --> 00:18:19.981
Captain!

00:18:20.064 --> 00:18:21.524
Captain Qoone!

00:18:24.402 --> 00:18:25.987
Why, you...!

00:18:55.600 --> 00:18:58.102
"The bridge has been
isolated in hyperspace”

00:18:58.478 --> 00:19:00.104
"Impossible to attack"

00:19:00.563 --> 00:19:02.106
"This was expected. No matter"

00:19:07.904 --> 00:19:09.280
Captain!

00:19:09.364 --> 00:19:16.037
Please... take this...

00:19:16.120 --> 00:19:18.414
Eris! The Captain!

00:19:19.374 --> 00:19:20.249
Captain!

00:19:20.333 --> 00:19:22.502
Captain! Captain!

00:19:22.585 --> 00:19:24.504
Eris, use your gizmo.

00:19:24.587 --> 00:19:25.963
Ah, right!

00:19:31.761 --> 00:19:33.721
Thank goodness! She's alive!

00:19:33.805 --> 00:19:36.766
Whew. Okay then, you can treat her.

00:19:36.849 --> 00:19:38.059
What is it?

00:19:38.142 --> 00:19:41.771
It's no use. These are nanomachines.

00:19:41.854 --> 00:19:45.525
She's not drugged; she's had
microscopic machines shot into her brain,

00:19:45.608 --> 00:19:48.069
and they are blocking her neurotransmitters.

00:19:48.152 --> 00:19:50.238
If I use my medical machine
without knowing what I'm doing,

00:19:50.321 --> 00:19:53.282
there's no telling how the
nanomachines might react.

00:19:56.744 --> 00:19:59.330
Captain! We have an emergency!

00:19:59.414 --> 00:20:00.790
Where is Captain Qoone?

00:20:00.873 --> 00:20:01.791
Well...

00:20:01.874 --> 00:20:04.127
Captain! What happened?!

00:20:04.210 --> 00:20:06.921
She was attacked by the dog people.

00:20:07.004 --> 00:20:08.339
You, too, huh?

00:20:08.423 --> 00:20:10.133
Has something happened?

00:20:10.216 --> 00:20:14.887
The Catia Ship has been attacked,
and is out of our control.

00:20:14.971 --> 00:20:18.224
Unless we do something, it will
plunge into the Earth in two weeks.

00:20:21.436 --> 00:20:23.354
What is the situation?

00:20:23.438 --> 00:20:26.649
We don't know for sure what has happened.

00:20:26.733 --> 00:20:29.610
Except for the bridge, which
fled into hyperspace,

00:20:29.694 --> 00:20:31.988
the rest of the crew appears to
have been frozen in time,

00:20:32.071 --> 00:20:33.614
and was unable to escape.

00:20:33.698 --> 00:20:35.616
Frozen in time?

00:20:35.700 --> 00:20:39.495
| didn't think the dogs
had that kind of technology.

00:20:39.579 --> 00:20:43.791
The ship's orbit has been locked in.
There isn't anything we can do.

00:20:43.875 --> 00:20:46.753
I'm coming to rescue you.
Is the teleporter working?

00:20:46.836 --> 00:20:51.174
No. All facilities outside the bridge
have fallen into enemy hands.

00:20:51.257 --> 00:20:54.343
All right, then. I'll call Luros.

00:20:55.261 --> 00:20:57.930
Terrible news! Emergenshy!

00:20:58.014 --> 00:20:59.599
What's the matter, Luros?

00:20:59.682 --> 00:21:05.396
I'm under attack! It'sh all
pow-pow, bang-bang, boom-boom!

00:21:05.480 --> 00:21:06.606
How bad is the damage?

00:21:06.689 --> 00:21:08.691
Right now, it'sh at 25 pershent.

00:21:08.775 --> 00:21:10.902
My camouflage function is completely deshtroyed.

00:21:10.985 --> 00:21:12.236
Who's doing it?

00:21:12.320 --> 00:21:14.322
They're canine weapons!

00:21:28.961 --> 00:21:31.798
My shields have almosht been canshelled.

00:21:31.881 --> 00:21:34.550
Engine load has reached 45 pershent.

00:21:34.634 --> 00:21:38.095
Luros, initiate Program "He," number 36.

00:21:38.179 --> 00:21:41.557
Okey-doke! Initiating
Program "He," number--

00:21:41.641 --> 00:21:44.018
Luros? Luros!

00:21:44.101 --> 00:21:45.895
Luros! Luros!

00:21:50.691 --> 00:21:54.028
The Catia Ship,
with those aboard unable to escape,

00:21:54.111 --> 00:21:56.614
is going to crash into the Earth.

00:21:56.697 --> 00:21:59.367
The captain is lying unconscious.

00:21:59.450 --> 00:22:02.995
Only two weeks remain.

00:22:03.079 --> 00:22:05.081
What will you do, Earth?

00:22:31.983 --> 00:22:35.152
You're there smiling next to me,

00:22:35.236 --> 00:22:39.949
but it looks like that alone won't do it

00:22:40.032 --> 00:22:47.832
I wish I could touch you,
like a misty breeze

00:22:47.915 --> 00:22:55.840
My feelings can't get out
of the forest of my memories

00:22:55.923 --> 00:23:02.555
They just go to show the
never-changing distance between us

00:23:02.638 --> 00:23:12.023
Our future is held hostage by
waning and waxing irreconcilability

00:23:12.106 --> 00:23:14.734
I have to break through

00:23:14.817 --> 00:23:19.196
Every time I think of you,

00:23:19.280 --> 00:23:22.700
the memories get in the way

00:23:22.783 --> 00:23:27.204
When I want to tenderly offer
you the side of me

00:23:27.288 --> 00:23:30.583
that no one else knows

00:23:30.666 --> 00:23:47.016
I'll follow my heart, and come to see you

00:23:54.482 --> 00:23:55.900
The straw millionaire!
Pennies from heaven! A lucky break!

00:23:55.983 --> 00:23:57.443
You can't let even the slightest
hope get away from you!

00:23:57.526 --> 00:23:59.028
The peace of the world
has been put in your hands!

00:23:59.111 --> 00:24:02.281
Who will be in the driver's seat tomorrow?

00:24:02.365 --> 00:24:04.659
Next time, "I Came Looking for You."

00:24:04.742 --> 00:24:08.329
I'm coming to drop in on you!

00:24:12.416 --> 00:24:13.459
"See you next time!"
